  "prefLabel": "En 1011.09 Witness Test Plan",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1011.09 Witness Test Plan. The applicant shall provide the utility with proposed witness test procedures and plans that comply with IEEE Std 1547™-2018, “IEEE Standard for Interconnection and Interoperability of Distributed Energy Resources with Associated Electric Power Systems Interfaces” dated 4/6/2018 as available in Appendix B and all requisite supporting documentation at least 30 business days before the anticipated in-service date. Within 10 business days from receipt of the witness test plan, the utility shall notify the applicant whether the witness test plan complies with applicable industry and utility standards and if it complies, then the utility shall approve the witness test plan.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
